      "f": "Discogs release 18053263（EMI Classics 7243 5 67001 2 3，1999，CD／Compilation／Repress／Mono）的說明欄逐字寫：「Total running time 1:07:31. **Originally released 1988.**」曲目就是《大公》與舒伯特第一號鋼琴三重奏兩首。",
