     {
      "f": "英文維基〈Pablo Casals〉記：「Back in Paris, Casals organized a trio with the pianist Alfred Cortot and the violinist Jacques Thibaud; they played concerts **from 1906 to 1933**, and made recordings **from 1926 to 1929**.」該句的引註（EMI CHS 7 64057 2 三片裝的內頁，Jean Loubier 撰）補充：已知最早的音樂會是 1906 年（可能更早），**最後一場是 1933 年 5 月 13 日在史特拉斯堡**。同條目的錄音年表列出「1926–1928: Casals, Jacques Thibaud and Alfred Cortot – the first trios of Schubert, Schumann and Mendelssohn, the Beethoven Archduke, Haydn's G major and Beethoven's Kakadu Variations（**recorded in London**）」。",
